              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Correct. Graph [A] vs. time and determine the slope of the tangent line at t = 15.0 s. This is the instantaneous rate of change of [A]. From the definition of reaction rate and the reaction stoichiometry, the instantaneous rate for the reaction =  "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "2225386825",
                        "src": "-\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack}{2\\;\\mathrm\\Delta t}",
                        "subtype": "latex",
                        "type": "formula_inline"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "3kijk55r8vq57a0",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2091852888"
              },
              "id": "3030425975",
              "legacyMatch": "[0.010,0.015]",
              "rule": "input = {[0.010,0.015]}",
              "score": 10
            },
            {
              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Incorrect. To find the instantaneous rate of reaction: "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "857tzsdy9em6rwi",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "pqclppnw4attm0l",
                            "text": "Carefully plot the [A] vs. t data and fit a smooth curve to the data points. The slope of the curve, which is "
                          },
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "eiv8d34wivstlue",
                                "text": ""
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "5blo3pst88ruots",
                            "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                            "src": "\\frac{\\triangle\\mathrm [A]}{\\triangle t}",
                            "subtype": "latex",
                            "type": "formula_inline"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "axh5c51efir0cga",
                            "text": ", at a given time is equal to the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "z6121b4p8gxu9y0",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "b32kcehxnp83rfk",
                            "text": "Carefully estimate the value of the slope at the given time to obtain the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "zp0fnwox7q3c7gx",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "j6f91xx4iqvx7m2",
                            "text": "Relate the rate of change of [A] to the reaction rate using the definition of reaction rate and the stoichiometric coefficient of the reactant A."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "wtqdp2eb3b2gtgy",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "ldcr1iugg9owoj8",
                            "text": "Solve for the reaction rate using the estimated rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "rx857q7vdn0ohjy",
                        "type": "li"
                      }
